  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "They should add a Direct Message system to VRChat for ease of use. \"Just use Discord\" what if you don't have said persons Discord? This would be a good way to get it, or just a good messaging alternative. \"Just use Room Invites to message\" ...no. Also, what if this user is offline and you want to see that message when they do get on? \"Just join their game\" what if you can't join this users game and want to join them? Also, there is that time where you *can* join someone but you want to stay in your own game where this would be helpful.\n\nIf they were to add this, they should also probably add a Group Chat so if you have a group of friends who are all chronically online, you can just talk to them via group chat. This goes back to that joining game thing where you can still be in contact while in different rooms.\n\nOverall, this would be such a small change to the game that would do wonders for the community. What are your thoughts?",
